#11600
The Pech Community~
This area was written by Joe Hunter (Joram/RavenMud).  It is intended for evil
characters, 35th to 40th level, as an experience area and to help maintain 
alignment.

Edited by Smythe to be a link-zon in the "Caves of Darkorne".

Smythe
November 1996
~
116 0 0 0 0 0
S
#11601
A Deep Mining Shaft~
You are standing at the bottom of a deep mining shaft.  A ladder, carved into
the sides of the shaft, stretches 40 foot up to the surface.  To the north you
see the darkness of a passage and the ladder leads up.
~
116 acdf 0 0 0 5
D0
A wide passage lies to the north.
~
~
