#11643
A Small Cavern~
You are standing in a cavern with smooth, finished walls but is only half the 
sizes of the others that are finished.  It is approximately 15 foot across and 
the perfectly round with a domed ceiling that peaks at approximately 12 foot.
For some reason, the pechs felt the need to stop the expansion of this cavern
and finish it at this size.  The only exit is back the way you came.
~
