#11644
A Deep, Subterranean Lake~
You are standing before a huge, underground lake.  The shape of the lake is  
roughly a circle that is over 100 foot across at any point and the cavern 
extends another 30 foot on all sides of the lake.  The walls of the cavern are 
rough and there are many ledges you can see although the light from your 
light source does not extend far enough for you to be able see the ceiling.
The lake is very still but the clean, crisp smell of the air in this cavern 
indicates to you the water is not stagnant.  The only exit is back the way 
you came in.
~
116 adf 0 0 0 5
D1
The mouth to the cavern lies to the east.
~
